@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram - Online Quiz System

state StartLogin
state TeacherMode
state StudentMode
state CreateQuiz
state EditQuiz
state SaveDraft
state PostQuiz
state ViewResults
state SelectQuiz
state AnswerQuiz
state SubmitQuiz
state ViewResult

[*] --> StartLogin
StartLogin --> TeacherMode: Login as teacher
StartLogin --> StudentMode: Login as student
TeacherMode --> CreateQuiz
TeacherMode --> EditQuiz
TeacherMode --> SaveDraft
TeacherMode --> PostQuiz
TeacherMode --> ViewResults
StudentMode --> SelectQuiz
SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult
@enduml
